# Mirrors .gitignore's excluded paths, since `vercel deploy`'s directory
# walk does not reliably respect .gitignore itself.
#
# scripts/conformance is deliberately NOT excluded even though it's a
# local-toolchain-only dev script directory: tests/cross-validation.test.ts
# imports from it, and Next.js's build type-checks every .ts file in the
# project (not just what next build actually bundles), so excluding it
# broke the Vercel build with unresolvable-import errors - verified
# directly by a real failed deploy, not assumed.
node_modules
.next
out
vendor
testbench
rtl
